---
/**
 * Highlights side panel / tab for the reader mock.
 * Lists active highlights with their notes and live count.
 * Displays the live synced Markdown representation:
 * "Highlights are written into the source's Markdown file too" with mono snippet.
 */
import { FileText, Highlighter, MessageSquare } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<aside class="reader-sidebar" id="reader-sidebar" aria-label="Article highlights and notes">
  <div class="sidebar-header">
    <div class="panel-tabs" role="tablist">
      <button
        type="button"
        class="panel-tab is-active"
        id="tab-highlights-btn"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="true"
        data-panel="highlights"
      >
        <Highlighter size={13} stroke-width={1.75} />
        <span>Highlights</span>
        <span class="count-pill nums" id="sidebar-highlights-badge">1</span>
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="panel-tab"
        id="tab-markdown-btn"
        role="tab"
        aria-selected="false"
        data-panel="markdown"
      >
        <FileText size={13} stroke-width={1.75} />
        <span>Markdown file</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sidebar-content">
    <!-- Panel 1: Highlights card list -->
    <div class="panel-view" id="panel-highlights-view">
      <div class="panel-caption">
        <p class="panel-caption-text">
          Highlights are written into the source's Markdown file too.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="highlights-list" id="sidebar-highlights-list">
        <!-- Default item corresponding to pre-marked quote -->
        <div class="highlight-card" data-card-id="hl-1">
          <div class="hl-stripe"></div>
          <div class="hl-body">
            <blockquote class="hl-quote serif">
              “Turbo lag, by contrast, is the transient delay between opening the throttle when operating above the boost threshold and the turbocharger reaching full boost”
            </blockquote>
            <div class="hl-note-row" id="note-row-hl-1">
              <MessageSquare size={11} stroke-width={1.75} class="hl-note-icon" />
              <span class="hl-note-text">Core distinction from boost threshold.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hl-footer">
              <span class="hl-time nums">Oct 22, 10:48</span>
              <button type="button" class="hl-jump-btn" data-jump="hl-1" title="Scroll to highlight">
                View in text
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Panel 2: Live Markdown file preview -->
    <div class="panel-view" id="panel-markdown-view" hidden>
      <div class="markdown-preview-header">
        <span class="file-name mono">turbo-lag-explained.md</span>
        <span class="chip chip-sm nums">Synced</span>
      </div>
      <div class="markdown-box">
        <pre class="mono markdown-code" id="markdown-live-output"><code>---
title: "How turbo lag actually works"
url: "https://grokipedia.com/page/Turbocharger"
saved: 2026-10-22
---

## My highlights

> "Turbo lag, by contrast, is the transient delay between opening the throttle when operating above the boost threshold and the turbocharger reaching full boost"
_Note: Core distinction from boost threshold._
</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .reader-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--card) 60%, var(--background));
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .sidebar-header {
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .panel-tabs {
    display: flex;
    background: var(--muted);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 2px;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .panel-tab {
    flex: 1;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    height: 28px;
    padding-inline: 8px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: transparent;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background-color 140ms var(--ease-out),
      color 140ms var(--ease-out);
  }

  .panel-tab:hover {
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .panel-tab.is-active {
    background: var(--card);
    color: var(--foreground);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
  }

  .count-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    padding-inline: 4px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--marker-soft);
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  .sidebar-content {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 14px;
  }

  .panel-view[hidden] {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .panel-caption {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: var(--muted);
  }

  .panel-caption-text {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .highlights-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  :global(.highlight-card) {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition:
      border-color 140ms var(--ease-out),
      box-shadow 140ms var(--ease-out);
  }

  :global(.highlight-card:hover) {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-raised);
  }

  :global(.hl-stripe) {
    width: 3px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--marker-strong);
  }

  :global(.hl-body) {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  :global(.hl-quote) {
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--foreground);
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  :global(.hl-note-row) {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--muted) 70%, transparent);
    padding: 3px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  :global(.hl-note-icon) {
    color: var(--source-note);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  :global(.hl-footer) {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding-top: 6px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  :global(.hl-time) {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  :global(.hl-jump-btn) {
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    padding: 2px 4px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: color 120ms var(--ease-out);
  }

  :global(.hl-jump-btn:hover) {
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  /* Markdown file preview */
  .markdown-preview-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .file-name {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }

  .chip-sm {
    height: 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    padding-inline: 7px;
  }

  .markdown-box {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .markdown-code {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--foreground);
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }
</style>
